# Example names

Use generic fixtures. Do not copy names from operator screenshots or from any one community.

- Workspaces: `Workspace A`, `Workspace B`
- Channels: `#general`, `#announcements`
- People: `Ada Lovelace`
- Connection labels: `Partner Org` (not a workspace name)
- Missing workspace name: `Workspace`
- URLs: `https://ws-a.example`, `https://peer.example`, `https://workspace-a.slack.com`

Do not use screenshot or community-specific names. GitHub org `F3Nation-Community` and deploy history stay as they are.
